{"id":"n31630-1-8","stage":3,"title":"그만큼 · 那些","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31630-1-8-1","ko":"왜 자꾸 날 귀찮게 하니?","zh":"为什么总是来烦我？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"날","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}},{"text":"귀찮게","meaning":"麻烦，厌烦","explanation":"귀찮다：麻烦，厌烦；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"귀찮다","audio":"/audio/133acb4be52ff131970f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37050","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀찮게","audio":"/audio/e6c0290514f70b9cf6e0.mp3"}},{"text":"하니?","meaning":"表示理由或依据。","explanation":"하다：表示理由或依据；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"8","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니","audio":"/audio/917bc632330b55c71985.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是",